uting work.","evidence_claim":"TCU describes the GIGA Lab as a first-floor library facility with hardware and software information and course-cleared access listings.","source_url":"https://library.tcu.edu/facilities-gigalab.asp","source_title":"Library Facilities: GIGA Lab | TCU Mary Couts Burnett Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located on the library’s first floor and open during library hours; consult the current cleared-course list or student request form for access.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"tcu-media-editing-rooms","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Media Editing Rooms","title":"Media Editing Rooms","subtitle":"Mary Couts Burnett Library · first floor","notes":"Reserve one of the two media editing rooms when a class project needs audio or video production and editing rather than ordinary desk work.","short_summary":"Two reservable first-floor rooms for audio and video production.","evidence_claim":"Mary Couts Burnett Library offers two Media Editing Rooms for audio and video production and editing, available by reservation only.","source_url":"https://library.tcu.edu/facilities-media-editing-rooms.asp","source_title":"Media Editing Rooms | TCU Mary Couts Burnett Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Reservation required; located on the library’s first floor and open during library hours.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"tcu-special-collections-reading-room","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Special Collections Reading Room","title":"Special Collections Reading Room","subtitle":"Mary Couts Burnett Library · third floor","notes":"Contact Special Collections ahead of a primary-source research session so staff can help